# Criterion 3: the rewritten storageInitializationProvider tests bite

Mutation applied to lib/core/di/providers.dart on top of merged main
(commit 08cad8d), then reverted:

    final storageInitializationProvider = FutureProvider<void>((ref) async {});

That is exactly the demonstration the issue describes: "replace the entire body
of storageInitializationProvider in lib/core/di/providers.dart:82 with
`async {}`. All five tests still pass." Output of the rewritten tests under the
same mutation follows.

